{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-compilation","title":"交叉编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/cross-compilation","wordCount":768,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"交叉编译\">交叉编译</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>交叉编译</strong>（Cross-Compilation）是在一个平台上生成另一个平台可执行文件的过程。CLI 工具的用户遍布多平台，发布时需要为每个 <strong>target triple</strong>（如 <code>x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</code>）产出对应二进制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cargo 原生</td>\n<td>需自备工具链/链接器</td>\n<td>工具链齐全的目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cross</td>\n<td>基于 Docker 提供预置工具链</td>\n<td>快速覆盖多目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cargo-zigbuild</td>\n<td>用 Zig 的链接器解决 glibc 兼容</td>\n<td>需要兼容旧 glibc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>musl 静态链接</td>\n<td>无动态依赖，单文件运行</td>\n<td>Alpine、最小化镜像</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>方案选择的实质是<strong>链接器与目标环境</strong>的匹配问题。本文从动机讲起，逐个介绍上述方案，最后给出多架构发布脚本。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要交叉编译\">为什么需要交叉编译</h2><p><strong>交叉编译</strong>（Cross-Compilation）是指在一个平台上编译出另一个平台的可执行文件。CLI 工具的用户遍布 Linux、macOS 和 Windows，发布时需要为每个平台提供预编译的二进制文件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标平台</th>\n<th>Target Triple</th>\n<th>常见场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Linux x86_64</td>\n<td><code>x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu</code></td>\n<td>服务器、CI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux ARM64</td>\n<td><code>aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu</code></td>\n<td>ARM 服务器、树莓派</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux musl</td>\n<td><code>x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</code></td>\n<td>静态链接、Alpine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>macOS x86_64</td>\n<td><code>x86_64-apple-darwin</code></td>\n<td>Intel Mac</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>macOS ARM64</td>\n<td><code>aarch64-apple-darwin</code></td>\n<td>Apple Silicon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td><code>x86_64-pc-windows-msvc</code></td>\n<td>Windows 桌面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[交叉编译]&#10;    B --&gt; C[linux-x86_64]&#10;    B --&gt; D[linux-arm64]&#10;    B --&gt; E[linux-musl]&#10;    B --&gt; F[macos-x86_64]&#10;    B --&gt; G[macos-arm64]&#10;    B --&gt; H[windows-x86_64]\">graph LR\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[交叉编译]\n    B --&gt; C[linux-x86_64]\n    B --&gt; D[linux-arm64]\n    B --&gt; E[linux-musl]\n    B --&gt; F[macos-x86_64]\n    B --&gt; G[macos-arm64]\n    B --&gt; H[windows-x86_64]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-原生交叉编译\">Cargo 原生交叉编译</h2><p>Rust 通过 <code>--target</code> 参数支持原生交叉编译，但需要安装目标平台的链接器和系统库。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Cargo.toml 配置&#10;// [package]&#10;// name = &quot;mytool&quot;&#10;// version = &quot;0.1.0&quot;&#10;// edition = &quot;2021&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Cargo.toml 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [package]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// name = \"mytool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// version = \"0.1.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// edition = \"2021\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 添加目标平台&#10;rustup target add x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;rustup target add aarch64-apple-darwin&#10;&#10;# 编译到指定目标&#10;cargo build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;cargo build --release --target aarch64-apple-darwin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加目标平台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aarch64-apple-darwin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译到指定目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aarch64-apple-darwin</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 <code>.cargo/config.toml</code> 中配置目标平台的链接器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[target.x86_64-unknown-linux-musl]&#10;linker = &quot;x86_64-linux-musl-gcc&quot;&#10;&#10;[target.aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu]&#10;linker = &quot;aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc&quot;&#10;&#10;[target.x86_64-pc-windows-gnu]&#10;linker = &quot;x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[target.x86_64-unknown-linux-musl]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>linker = \"x86_64-linux-musl-gcc\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[target.aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>linker = \"aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[target.x86_64-pc-windows-gnu]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>linker = \"x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc\"</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cross-工具\">Cross 工具</h2><p><strong>cross</strong> 通过 Docker 容器提供开箱即用的交叉编译环境，无需手动安装交叉编译工具链。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 cross&#10;cargo install cross --git https://github.com/cross-rs/cross&#10;&#10;# 使用方式与 cargo 完全相同&#10;cross build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;cross build --release --target aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu&#10;cross build --release --target x86_64-pc-windows-gnu\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 cross</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cross</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/cross-rs/cross</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用方式与 cargo 完全相同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cross</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cross</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cross</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-pc-windows-gnu</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cargo + rustup</td>\n<td>无额外依赖</td>\n<td>需手动配置链接器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cross</td>\n<td>开箱即用</td>\n<td>需要 Docker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cargo-zigbuild</td>\n<td>快速，无 Docker</td>\n<td>依赖 Zig</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-zigbuild\">Cargo-zigbuild</h2><p><strong>cargo-zigbuild</strong> 使用 Zig 的 C 编译器作为链接器，无需 Docker 即可交叉编译到大多数平台。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;cargo install cargo-zigbuild&#10;pip install ziglang&#10;&#10;# 编译&#10;cargo zigbuild --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu&#10;cargo zigbuild --release --target aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu&#10;cargo zigbuild --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;&#10;# 同时编译多个目标&#10;cargo zigbuild --release \\&#10;  --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu \\&#10;  --target aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cargo-zigbuild</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ziglang</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zigbuild</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zigbuild</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zigbuild</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 同时编译多个目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zigbuild</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> cargo-zigbuild 特别适合在 macOS 上交叉编译 Linux 二进制文件，速度快且配置简单。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"musl-静态链接\">Musl 静态链接</h2><p><strong>musl</strong> 是 C 标准库的轻量级实现，编译出的二进制文件完全静态链接，无需系统库依赖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 musl 目标&#10;rustup target add x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;&#10;# 静态编译&#10;cargo build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;&#10;# 验证静态链接&#10;file target/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/release/mytool&#10;# mytool: ELF 64-bit LSB executable, statically linked\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 musl 目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 静态编译</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证静态链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/release/mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># mytool: ELF 64-bit LSB executable, statically linked</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>链接方式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动态链接 (glibc)</td>\n<td>体积小</td>\n<td>依赖系统库版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态链接 (musl)</td>\n<td>零依赖分发</td>\n<td>体积稍大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于需要 OpenSSL 的项目，使用 <code>vendored</code> 特性编译静态版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[dependencies]&#10;reqwest = { version = &quot;0.12&quot;, features = [&quot;rustls-tls&quot;] }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reqwest = { version = \"0.12\", features = [\"rustls-tls\"] }</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>rustls</code> 替代 OpenSSL 可以避免交叉编译时的 OpenSSL 依赖问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多架构发布脚本\">多架构发布脚本</h2><p>完整的发布流程通常通过 CI 脚本自动化。以下是一个构建多平台二进制的脚本示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::process::Command;&#10;&#10;struct Target {&#10;    triple: &amp;&#39;static str,&#10;    ext: &amp;&#39;static str,&#10;}&#10;&#10;const TARGETS: &amp;[Target] = &amp;[&#10;    Target { triple: &quot;x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&quot;, ext: &quot;&quot; },&#10;    Target { triple: &quot;aarch64-unknown-linux-musl&quot;, ext: &quot;&quot; },&#10;    Target { triple: &quot;x86_64-apple-darwin&quot;, ext: &quot;&quot; },&#10;    Target { triple: &quot;aarch64-apple-darwin&quot;, ext: &quot;&quot; },&#10;    Target { triple: &quot;x86_64-pc-windows-msvc&quot;, ext: &quot;.exe&quot; },&#10;];&#10;&#10;fn build_target(name: &amp;str, target: &amp;Target) {&#10;    println!(&quot;编译 {} ({})&quot;, name, target.triple);&#10;    let status = Command::new(&quot;cargo&quot;)&#10;        .args([&quot;zigbuild&quot;, &quot;--release&quot;, &quot;--target&quot;, target.triple])&#10;        .status()&#10;        .expect(&quot;编译失败&quot;);&#10;&#10;    if !status.success() {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;编译失败: {}&quot;, target.triple);&#10;        std::process::exit(1);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let src = format!(&quot;target/{}/release/{}{}&quot;, target.triple, name, target.ext);&#10;    let dst = format!(&quot;dist/{}-{}{}&quot;, name, target.triple, target.ext);&#10;    std::fs::create_dir_all(&quot;dist&quot;).ok();&#10;    std::fs::copy(&amp;src, &amp;dst).expect(&quot;复制失败&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;  → {}&quot;, dst);&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let name = &quot;mytool&quot;;&#10;    for target in TARGETS {&#10;        build_target(name, target);&#10;    }&#10;    println!(&quot;所有目标构建完成!&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::process::Command;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Target {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    triple: &#x26;'static str,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ext: &#x26;'static str,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const TARGETS: &#x26;[Target] = &#x26;[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Target { triple: \"x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\", ext: \"\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Target { triple: \"aarch64-unknown-linux-musl\", ext: \"\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Target { triple: \"x86_64-apple-darwin\", ext: \"\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Target { triple: \"aarch64-apple-darwin\", ext: \"\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Target { triple: \"x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\", ext: \".exe\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn build_target(name: &#x26;str, target: &#x26;Target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"编译 {} ({})\", name, target.triple);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let status = Command::new(\"cargo\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .args([\"zigbuild\", \"--release\", \"--target\", target.triple])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .status()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .expect(\"编译失败\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if !status.success() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"编译失败: {}\", target.triple);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::process::exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let src = format!(\"target/{}/release/{}{}\", target.triple, name, target.ext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let dst = format!(\"dist/{}-{}{}\", name, target.triple, target.ext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::fs::create_dir_all(\"dist\").ok();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::fs::copy(&#x26;src, &#x26;dst).expect(\"复制失败\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"  → {}\", dst);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let name = \"mytool\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for target in TARGETS {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        build_target(name, target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"所有目标构建完成!\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[git tag v1.0.0] --&gt; B[CI 触发]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Linux x86_64]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Linux ARM64]&#10;    B --&gt; E[macOS x86_64]&#10;    B --&gt; F[macOS ARM64]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Windows x86_64]&#10;    C --&gt; H[打包为 tar.gz]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; I[打包为 zip]&#10;    H --&gt; J[GitHub Release]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[git tag v1.0.0] --&gt; B[CI 触发]\n    B --&gt; C[Linux x86_64]\n    B --&gt; D[Linux ARM64]\n    B --&gt; E[macOS x86_64]\n    B --&gt; F[macOS ARM64]\n    B --&gt; G[Windows x86_64]\n    C --&gt; H[打包为 tar.gz]\n    D --&gt; H\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; I[打包为 zip]\n    H --&gt; J[GitHub Release]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((交叉编译))&#10;    目标平台&#10;      Linux glibc/musl&#10;      macOS Intel/ARM&#10;      Windows MSVC&#10;    工具选择&#10;      cargo 原生&#10;      cross (Docker)&#10;      cargo-zigbuild (Zig)&#10;    Musl 静态链接&#10;      零依赖分发&#10;      rustls 替代 OpenSSL&#10;    发布流程&#10;      CI 矩阵构建&#10;      多平台二进制&#10;      GitHub Release\">mindmap\n  root((交叉编译))\n    目标平台\n      Linux glibc/musl\n      macOS Intel/ARM\n      Windows MSVC\n    工具选择\n      cargo 原生\n      cross (Docker)\n      cargo-zigbuild (Zig)\n    Musl 静态链接\n      零依赖分发\n      rustls 替代 OpenSSL\n    发布流程\n      CI 矩阵构建\n      多平台二进制\n      GitHub Release</pre><ul>\n<li>交叉编译让一个代码仓库产出多平台二进制，是 CLI 工具分发的基础</li>\n<li>cross 通过 Docker 提供开箱即用的体验，cargo-zigbuild 更轻量且无需 Docker</li>\n<li>musl 静态链接实现零依赖分发，适合 Linux 环境的广泛兼容</li>\n<li>使用 rustls 替代 OpenSSL 可以避免交叉编译中最常见的依赖问题</li>\n<li>CI 中的矩阵构建应覆盖所有目标平台，自动化打包发布到 GitHub Release</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交叉编译","id":"交叉编译"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要交叉编译","id":"为什么需要交叉编译"},{"level":2,"text":"Cargo 原生交叉编译","id":"cargo-原生交叉编译"},{"level":2,"text":"Cross 工具","id":"cross-工具"},{"level":2,"text":"Cargo-zigbuild","id":"cargo-zigbuild"},{"level":2,"text":"Musl 静态链接","id":"musl-静态链接"},{"level":2,"text":"多架构发布脚本","id":"多架构发布脚本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Tokio 异步 CLI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/tokio-for-cli"},"next":{"title":"二进制优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/binary-optimization"}}